-- DL Cabinetry: NEW masters and pending SKUs for the previously unmatched DL items. PREPARED, NOT RUN. Do not run without Tom's review.
-- Sources: DL Specification Book v.11/14/23 (page per item in dl_spec_book_items.csv), DL Price List P5 (v1_13_26), master description sheet 2026-10-26 (live DB was not queried). Decisions: Tom, Oct 31, 2026.
-- Generated by build_unmatched.py. One statement per numbered block. Every statement is guarded (NOT EXISTS on masterCode / alias / platformSku) so re-running is safe.
-- INSERT blocks: new master cabinets are inserted unpublished (isActive = FALSE, showInDesigner = FALSE, showInCatalog = FALSE, showIn2020 = FALSE) and every DL SKU is isPublished = FALSE, status = 'pending'.
-- Publishing happens ONLY in the clearly labeled PUBLISH SECTION at the end (Tom runs it by hand). Rules F and G: a new master is never left unpublished, and unsure items are published AND flagged.
-- NO PRICE CHANGES: every SKU keeps DL's own price-list price as-is (WG / WDCG glass-door SKUs included). New masters keep DL's nominal W/H/D (rule I); DL's own description, dims and spec page also sit on the DL SKU (supplierCabinetName, geometry*).
-- CABINET CONFLICT (rule C, AUTOMATIC): the generator writes a conflictStatus / conflictReason / conflictedAt entry for every UNIQUE or UNSURE item, with no manual step:
--   every new master (unique to DL) and every previously report-only item is inserted with conflictStatus = 'review'; every existing master that received a MEDIUM-confidence DL mapping gets conflictStatus = 'review' (UPDATE ... WHERE conflictStatus = 'none', so an existing flag is never overwritten).
--   'review' is the existing public status: the row stays usable everywhere and is listed in Admin > Cabinet Conflict. Nothing in this file removes a master or alias row (rule H).
-- BEFORE running: confirm in the live database that none of the NEW master codes already exists under another code, and that each MAPPED master exists.

-- Block 1: NEW hidden master 2DB33 (Tom FINAL Oct 31: 2DB33 is a UNIQUE item with its own master; it is never linked, aliased, substituted or cross-referenced to any regular base cabinet. DL spec book: 33in two-drawer base, 0 doors, 2 drawers. Priced at DL's own 2DB33 price-list prices). Source: DL Specification Book v.11/14/23 p.2. Any value not in the source is NULL. CABINET CONFLICT entry added automatically (review, stays public once published).
INSERT INTO cabinet_dealz.cabinets (masterCode, description, descriptionSource, category, subCategory, width, height, depth, placementType, numberOfDoors, numberOfDrawers, isCornerCabinet, cornerType, isActive, showInDesigner, showInCatalog, showIn2020, isNotCabinet, specNotes, conflictStatus, conflictReason, conflictedAt)
SELECT '2DB33', 'Drawer Base - 33"W x 34.5"H x 24"D, 0 door(s), 2 drawer(s), 0 shelf(ves)', 'DL Cabinetry spec book v.11/14/23', 'Base', 'Drawer Base', 33, 34.5, 24, 'base', 0, 2, FALSE, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, NULL, 'review', 'Issue: Unique to DL: no existing master matched (Tom FINAL Oct 31: 2DB33 is a UNIQUE item with its own master; it is never linked, aliased, substituted or cross-referenced to any regular base cabinet. DL spec book: 33in two-drawer base, 0 doors, 2 drawers. Priced at DL''s own 2DB33 price-list prices).
Current value: Drawer Base - 33"W x 34.5"H x 24"D, 0 door(s), 2 drawer(s), 0 shelf(ves)
Source: DL Specification Book v.11/14/23 p.2
Needed: Admin confirms the item, its category and master code (and whether another supplier carries it), then clears the flag.
Resolved fields: description, category, subCategory, width, height, depth', NOW()
FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM cabinet_dealz.cabinets WHERE masterCode = '2DB33')
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM cabinet_dealz.cabinet_aliases WHERE alias = '2DB33');

